text.en:
Section 28 of the Act is amended -

(a) in subsection (I), by deleting "Institut" from the third line and by substituting "Universiti" therefor;

(b) in subsection (2), by deleting "Institut" from the second line and by substituting "Universiti" therefor.

The Schedule to the Act is amended -

(a) in paragraph 1 -

(i) in sub-paragraph (I), by deleting "Institut" and by substituting "Universiti" therefor;

(ii) in sub-paragraph (2), by deleting "Institut" from the second line and by substituting "Universiti" therefor;

(b) in paragraph 47(1), by deleting "Institut" from the second line and by substituting "Universiti" therefor.
